  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/01/IMG_2340.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Mucha animaci&oacute;n en La Toska, en El Pla de Onda, con la actuaci&oacute;n de Sambuca,</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/01/IMG_2362-6.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>en New Robinson de la calle San Bernardo, 17, que ha acogido el concierto de Sonia y sus Secuaces y por &uacute;ltima noche en el pabell&oacute;n V&iacute;ctor Cabedo Carda,</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/01/IMG_2496.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>con la orquesta La Pato, organizada por el Consell de Festes y gestionada por Ocultas Producciones.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bonanitdereis17/img_2311.jpg\" alt=\"img_2311\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bonanitdereis17/img_2313.jpg\" alt=\"img_2313\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bonanitdereis17/img_2314.jpg\" alt=\"img_2314\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bonanitdereis17/img_2317.jpg\" alt=\"img_2317\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bonanitdereis17/img_2318.jpg\" alt=\"img_2318\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bonanitdereis17/img_2320.jpg\" alt=\"img_2320\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/bonanitdereis17/img_2321.jpg\" alt=\"img_2321\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"http